---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Animesh Kundu and these essays.">
  <section class="page measure">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1>A quiet place for essays.</h1>
    <p>
      I am Animesh Kundu. I write about the parts of ordinary life that keep asking for a second look: streets, rooms, habits, tools, taste, attention, work, and the small choices that become a way of living.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is meant to feel like a well lit table. Few objects, enough space, and room for the sentence to do its work. Some pieces will be firm essays. Some will be short notes. All of them begin from the same belief: the daily world is not background. It is where our values become visible.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a piece sends you outside with sharper eyes, or makes a familiar object feel less settled, it has done enough.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
